<i>Because even in the deepest gloom...</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.570
<i>I'd be able to relax and 
melt into the darkness.</i>

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:33.460
<i>Even now that I've reached this age, 
I still suffer from chuunibyou syndrome.</i>

