still not getting an SS rare card...</i>

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:39.110
What is it, Torasuke?

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:40.820
Is it your new fav?

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:46.200
It's a time-limited, 
SS rare Lasally Naim-chan.

