00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:54.300
To think you'd be two-timing, Kosuke. 
Pretty cocky of you.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.650
Ibarada-kun.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.140
Can I have a moment?

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:03.160
<i>Graduate students must one day graduate.</i>

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:12.550
I'd like for you to proceed into a doctoral 
course and continue your research here.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:15.880
I could keep going and get a doctorate here.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:19.750
But graduating and passing the time, 
however, might be nice, too.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:24.800
I guess right now I just don't feel 
like thinking about the future.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:30.160
But there is a deadline for the application, 
so you need to decide soon.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.290
Speaking of deadlines, professor...

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.070
Hm?

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:36.950
Did you finish your article for the 
university promotional brochure?

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:41.610
While you're pestering me 
about my courses so much,

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.190
you wouldn't have forgotten 
about your own work, would you?

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.690
I have to think!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:52.960
Well then, I'll be counting on you 
to get it done by the deadline.

00:03:56.930 --> 00:04:00.960
Welcome home, Ena-chan.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.460
I'm back.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:08.220
Ena-chan, you're always 
so pretty, aren't you?

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:13.980
You're small and fluffy and cute...

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.230
It's really such a waste.

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:20.240
Hey. Why'd you go somewhere 
like university anyway?

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.480
Because mid-term presentations 
are coming up.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:29.110
<i>This house is as dark as 
the depths of the abyss.</i>

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:33.000
<i>Though I've already grown 
completely used to it.</i>

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.370
Professor?

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:41.150
Have you made the promotional 
brochure correctly?

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:47.000
I've created something truly splendid!

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:52.870
Any high schooler who reads this will want 
to come to our university! I'm sure of it!

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.240
Really?

